      "cooked": "<p>No fighting or fing around to fix this issue.</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-308-writers-room-filter-4\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-308-writers-room-filter-4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img width=\"250\" height=\"250\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/c/ca864864fd4764e914bcab3670be2db68d1c0662.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" data-dominant-color=\"938C83\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-308-writers-room-filter-4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Letters Page: Episode #308 - Writers' Room: F.I.L.T.E.R. #4</a></h3>\n\n  <p>K.N.Y.F.E.! No Punch!  Show Notes: Run Time: 1:49:09 We may have bit off more than we can chew with this one... but we'll do our best!&nbsp; Actually, it turned out really well, in our opinion, making us stretch as creators and also making Paige...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/a/a3a9ba705c802d4626e55584fcf0b6e1879565d3.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/a3a9ba705c802d4626e55584fcf0b6e1879565d3\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/a3a9ba705c802d4626e55584fcf0b6e1879565d3_2_322x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"nlPt4dAZD66fIgx7R9o7e6zXznt\" width=\"322\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/a3a9ba705c802d4626e55584fcf0b6e1879565d3_2_322x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/a3a9ba705c802d4626e55584fcf0b6e1879565d3_2_483x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/a3a9ba705c802d4626e55584fcf0b6e1879565d3_2_644x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"B3C9B9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1320×2047 714 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
