      "id": 262315,
      "name": "KateWalker",
      "username": "TakeWalker",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2025-02-04T20:51:29.752Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Damn, that cover looks awesome.</p>\n<p>I put less sugar in my tea than shows up in a can of pop! &gt;:V Tea is a vehicle for sugar!</p>\n<p>Okay, I was wondering about Steel Team 6 lol</p>\n<p>Loving this ‘lots of Paiges’ idea.</p>\n<p>British and quite fay, apparently!</p>\n<p>Adam bringing up Sentennial XD</p>\n<p>Ooh, Paige Huntley being the administrator is fantastic. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>Adam and I said “Do <em>and</em> disturb” at the same time. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>A 1 in a stat will give you a -5 modifier if I’m not mistaken.</p>\n<p>More K.N.Y.F.E.s than you’ve had hot meals! Or golden guns!</p>\n<p>How have I never heard anyone refer to close-quarters combat as CQC before? That sounds so much cooler!</p>\n<p>Who came up with Virtuoso of the Void Jim Brooks? What a concept! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>So thankful Adam did a morbin’ time joke. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>Oh no, now I feel so bad for Man-Grove. D: Help him!</p>\n<p>Don’t feel bad, guys, the actual comic was good. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
